摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Local first, desktop companion platform with animated pets, plugin SDK and coding-agent integrations.","id":"gh:1229168545","install_available":false,"language":"TypeScript","name":"openpets","slug":"OpenPetsHQ/openpets","topics":["ai-agents","claude-code","coding-agents","desktop-companion","desktop-pet","dsh-plugin","electron","mcp","opencode","openpets","plugin-sdk","plugins","typescript"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Local first, desktop companion platform with animated pets, plugin SDK and coding-agent integrations"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"ocal first, desktop companion platform with animated pets, plugin SDK and coding-agent integrations."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"A desktop companion platform with pets, plugins, and optional local agent integrations."},{"id":"p3s1","text":"OpenPets puts an animated companion on your desktop, then lets plugins turn it into a focus buddy, r"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"eminder system, tiny game, launcher, or coding-agent sidekick."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"by Boring Dystopia Development"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"Read this in: English | 日本語 | 한국어 | 简体中文 | 繁體中文 | Português (Brasil) | Español (LatAm)"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Download OpenPets"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"**Download the latest OpenPets desktop release** and launch it. A pet appears immediately; no agent "},{"id":"p7s2","text":"latest OpenPets desktop release** and launch it. A pet appears immediately; no agent setup required."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"- **Desktop pets**: animated companions that idle, wander, react, and keep your workspace from feeli"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"ng empty.\n- **Official plugins**: focus timers, reminders, mood check-ins, mini games, launch shortc"},{"id":"p8s3","text":"uts, hydration nudges, and virtual-pet stats.\n- **Plugin SDK v3**: a sandboxed JavaScript/TypeScript"},{"id":"p8s4","text":" runtime for building new pet abilities with permissions, quotas, storage, schedules, commands, pane"},{"id":"p8s5","text":"ls, events, audio, notifications, and more.\n- **Optional agent layer**: Claude Code, OpenCode, Curso"},{"id":"p8s6","text":"r, Devin, Pi, and MCP clients can drive local pet reactions without exposing prompts, code, paths, l"},{"id":"p8s7","text":"ogs, or secrets in speech bubbles."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## Star OpenPets"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"If OpenPets makes your coding setup or desktop workspace a little more fun, please give the repo a s"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"penPets makes your coding setup or desktop workspace a little more fun, please give the repo a star."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## For Users: Getting Started"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"You do not need to be a developer or connect any AI agents to enjoy OpenPets. The desktop app is ful"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"ly functional out of the box with the official plugin lineup."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"### 1. Install OpenPets Desktop"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Download the package for your operating system from OpenPets Releases, or use the community-maintain"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"ed AUR package on Arch-based Linux:"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"- **macOS Apple Silicon**: `OpenPets-*-mac-arm64.dmg`\n- **macOS Intel**: `OpenPets-*-mac-x64.dmg`\n- "},{"id":"p15s2","text":"**Windows**: `OpenPets-*-win-x64-setup.exe`\n- **Linux**: `OpenPets-*-linux-x86_64.AppImage`\n- **Arch"},{"id":"p15s3","text":" Linux / CachyOS**: Install the community-maintained `openpets-bin` AUR package by @pinoybear with `"},{"id":"p15s4","text":"paru -S openpets-bin` (or `yay -S openpets-bin`)."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"> Note: Windows release installers are signed. macOS builds may still be unsigned and can trigger a "},{"id":"p16s2","text":"security warning; if macOS blocks execution, remove the quarantine flag via terminal:\n>\n[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"### 2. Manage and Customize Pets"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"Browse installed pets, preview their animation frames, and configure which pet monitors each workspa"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"ce or agent window from the built-in **Pet Gallery**."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"### 3. Enable Official Plugins"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"OpenPets v3 ships with a modular **Official Plugin Catalog**. Enable or configure plugins via the de"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"sktop Control Center to add focus timers, reminders, and mini interactive games."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"#### Shipped official lineup"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"- **Day Routine**: Tracks habits and reminds you to stretch or step away.\n- **Focus Buddy**: Pomodor"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"o-style focus timers to manage work cycles.\n- **Fortune Cookie**: Cracks open randomized daily advic"},{"id":"p22s3","text":"e and wisdom.\n- **Launch Buddy**: Allows registering shortcut commands to quickly open local folders"},{"id":"p22s4","text":", projects, or applications.\n- **Magic 8 Ball**: Ask questions and receive playful, randomized answe"},{"id":"p22s5","text":"rs from your pet.\n- **Mood Check-in**: Periodically checks in on your mood to support emotional well"},{"id":"p22s6","text":"-being.\n- **Reminders**: Renders snoozeable, bell-alert notifications with custom audio tones.\n- **V"},{"id":"p22s7","text":"irtual Pet**: Turns your desktop companion into a Tamagotchi-style pet with hunger, affection, and e"},{"id":"p22s8","text":"nergy levels tracked via a live status pin.\n- **Water Reminder**: Keeps you hydrated with regular, c"},{"id":"p22s9","text":"ustomizable drinking prompts."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## Plugin Platform & SDK v3"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"The OpenPets plugin system offers a secure, developer-friendly SDK (`@open-pets/plugin-sdk`) for cre"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"ating custom companion behavior."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"### Security & Architecture\n- **Sandboxed Runtime**: Each JS plugin runs inside a sandboxed BrowserW"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"indow host environment.\n- **Host-Rendered UI**: Plugins describe actions, HUDs, and notifications; t"},{"id":"p25s3","text":"he desktop host renders them. HTML/JS code cannot render raw HTML or execute arbitrary scripting ins"},{"id":"p25s4","text":"ide a pet window.\n- **Permissions Model**: Permissions must be declared in the manifest and approved"},{"id":"p25s5","text":" by the user at install. Flagged sensitive APIs (like `voice:listen`, `clipboard`, and `pet:speak:dy"},{"id":"p25s6","text":"namic`) require explicit consent toggles.\n- **SSRF & Private Host Guards**: Network fetch requests a"},{"id":"p25s7","text":"re limited to developer-declared hostnames and guarded against local SSRF."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"### How it works\nWhen you configure an agent, OpenPets exposes standard MCP tools. The agent can tri"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"gger animations, change status, and display text bubbles locally:\n1. **Claude Code**: Installs OpenP"},{"id":"p26s3","text":"ets MCP, memory instructions in `~/.claude/CLAUDE.md`, and hooks in `~/.claude/settings.json`.\n2. **"},{"id":"p26s4","text":"OpenCode**: Installs OpenPets MCP, custom project instruction files, and the `@open-pets/opencode` a"},{"id":"p26s5","text":"utomatic hook plugin.\n3. **Devin Desktop + Devin CLI**: Adds OpenPets MCP to the shared `~/.config/d"},{"id":"p26s6","text":"evin/mcp_config.json` plus lifecycle hooks for both (`openpets configure --agent devin`).\n4. **Curso"},{"id":"p26s7","text":"r / Other MCP Clients**: Register OpenPets as a standard stdio or TCP MCP server."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"### Local Privacy & Safety\n- All automated reactions run on static local triggers (e.g., when a comm"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"and runs or a file is written).\n- Speech content is validated to prevent leaking sensitive variables"},{"id":"p27s3","text":", paths, secrets, or multiline code snippets.\n- Real-time interaction requires a local discovery tok"},{"id":"p27s4","text":"en write/read, protecting the IPC bridge from external network triggers."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"### Prerequisites\n- **Node.js**: version 20 or higher\n- **pnpm**: version 11 or higher\n- **TypeScrip"},{"id":"p28s2","text":"t**: compiler support"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"## Safety and Privacy"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"- **Local-Only**: OpenPets IPC works using a local socket/named pipe, secured with a per-run random "},{"id":"p30s2","text":"security token.\n- **SSRF Safety**: Plugin network connections are restricted to approved domains and"},{"id":"p30s3","text":" blocked from local network/private IP access.\n- **Dynamic Content Sanitization**: Any dynamic AI-sp"},{"id":"p30s4","text":"eech text runs through strict local filters to redact paths, URLs, secrets, or multiline code snippe"},{"id":"p30s5","text":"ts.\n- **Sensitive Permission Consent**: Features accessing clipboard, microphone, or dynamic AI resp"},{"id":"p30s6","text":"onses are off by default and require explicit user opt-in."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
